              "text": "<evidence id=\"E1\" sha256=\"754043c1823f5c5ecbe29d16ab45d01fc5e8e61af4af43c4bcd6a675d134b23a\" kind=\"text\" label=\"invoice evidence\">\nINVOICE\nIssued: 12 May 2025\nSeller: Kavya Neral\nBuyer: Mira Velan\n\nIndigo batik print cotton fabric, 6 metres: INR 4,200\nInternational shipping: INR 600\nTotal: INR 4,800\n\nPayment method: PayPal\n\nThe fabric will be packed folded in a protective wrapping. Shipping is to the delivery details supplied separately by the buyer. Any import charges at destination are the buyer's responsibility. Please check the quantity and print description before payment; contact the seller if anything needs changing. Dispatch will be arranged after payment is received.\n</evidence>"
